{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1878,
      "hub_id": 2539,
      "guid": "com.fivef.unrestrictedarmorplate",
      "name": "Unrestricted Armor Plate",
      "slug": "unrestricted-armor-plate",
      "teaser": "Allows to insert any Armor Plate into any Armored Chest Rig​ or Armor Vest​.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2539.png",
      "downloads": 21560,
      "favourites_count": 24,
      "description": "<p>This is mainly for ArmorPlate, but also works on BuiltInInserts.<br />\n \nBuiltInInserts is disable by default. You can enable it in config.jsonc file.\n </p>\n<p><strong>Armor plates</strong> are divided into <strong><code>front+back</code></strong>, <strong><code>side</code></strong>.<br />\n<strong>BuiltInInserts</strong> are divided into <strong><code>front+back</code></strong>, <strong><code>side</code></strong>, <strong><code>groin</code></strong>, <strong><code>shoulder</code></strong>, <strong><code>collar</code></strong>.<br />\n<strong>BuiltInInserts</strong> for <strong>helmets</strong> are divided intro <strong><code>top</code></strong>, <strong><code>back</code></strong>, <strong><code>ears</code></strong>.</p>\n<p>To get build-in you need take it from other armor/rig - there are no option to buy build-in.<br />\nPMC’s wills spawn with random available build-in, if BuiltInInserts are enabled.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/oV9Soun\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Example preview</a><br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/4btyIhZ\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Example preview 2</a></p>\n<p><strong>Issues</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The quest <code>Sew it Good - Part 2</code> is easier to complete if BuiltInInserts are enabled.</li>\n<li>At least one armor (BNTI Zhuk body armor (Press)) uses armorPlateColliders from two systems at once (Plate_Granit_SAPI_chest, Plate_Korund_chest)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>How to install</strong>:<br />\nDrop the contents of <code>FiveF-unrestrictedArmorPlate-2.0.0.zip</code> to the path of SPT.</p>\n<p><strong>Hot to uninstall</strong>:<br />\nDelete <code>FiveF-unrestrictedArmorPlate</code> folder from <code>SPTarkov400\\SPT\\user\\mods\\</code>.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1878/unrestricted-armor-plate",
